          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Body recomposition is real, and it is most achievable for beginners, people returning to training and those carrying more body fat. What drives it is progressive resistance training, a modest calorie deficit or maintenance calories, enough sleep, and about 1.6 to 2.2 g of protein per kilogram a day. Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard is the best everyday powder for hitting that target, with Dymatize ISO100 and Transparent Labs as leaner upgrades and Orgain's protein plus creatine for plant-based eaters.
          </p>
